meta {
  name: Margins
  type: http
  seq: 5
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/super-admin/v1/models/margins?lifetime_months=36
  body: none
  auth: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{superAdminToken}}
}

params:query {
  lifetime_months: 36
}

docs {
  For each model the platform pays for: what a typical message costs you against what its credits earn on each plan. A lifetime price is spread over `lifetime_months`. `status`: ok, thin (under 20% of revenue), loss, unpriced, no_paid_plan, not_paid_by_platform.
}
